# The optimization program's follow-up rounds (O3 and O6 of ~/.cache/kosa-dev/flatshare-opt), round 2 of 2, on Gray,
# on a fresh sample of the agents (seed 37): the configuration the rounds measured, the same with the agents'
# decodes held from a call's first 16 tokens (the opt-*-hold arms), and that with speculative decoding too (the
# opt-*-spec arms), beside 24 session trees of the discriminating scenario with 2 and 4 callers.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/opt-s2.campaign

agents-seed 37

# engine make-room, the program's optimizations; then the decode hold; then speculative decoding too
arms/opt-disc-spec-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-spec-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-hold-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-hold-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-ret-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-ret-c4-s24.toml
